71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3s3gkm_22GsQ7kNvwFm6nU-&_nc_oc=Adqb-EzcLM9tLTTnV9Ey_fbQXW4CWztnRP7SNR6yRIsmzqSa4MmRSGmuF7dBH5P_eGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCI-E9x4cWUjr63oBmbT3wnNBDMTufFi5Op0d2xX4NqIQ&oe=6A5B7B39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cAfEECFDB3kQ7kNvwGJH5Xk&_nc_oc=AdqhPCmkLfeMNKwBovFcjAH-ZmQZ2fjaTr68xSl0LstO396kUHtvLaUc24j_VJKQlw0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAB4kEuUMWTI3jOVv0t1l89UaZyDNvowOxf8san22bSjg&oe=6A5B8E13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r3_O5Q5vJAAQ7kNvwFfbXzx&_nc_oc=AdpE7CYcaaG4BK0MQ1yerLSwbc5y4N1LPCeYm3VM6ytt00VdeGhcDUn1POHnV0A7cCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCnN0ye-YO0EyKjOClWBjUzu2vgoGGhK8g_t2gXZBhAUQ&oe=6A5B8C5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: